{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"c19ad409-a196-46cf-af38-8d9cb4448a52","step_index":6,"state":"DONE","step_type":"agent_response","text_delta":"{\"_kritt_extractor_helper\":true,\"results\":[],\"stub\":true,\"stub_explanation\":\"The flow in Raffle.settleWinningTicket through _settleWinningTicket, ticketRange, and _requireWinningTicket is properly protected. Reaching NftWon or CashWon status requires VRF fulfillment after at least one entry is sold, ensuring winningEntry is strictly within [1, totalEntries]. Minted tickets partition [1, totalEntries] into disjoint non-empty intervals, while unminted ticket IDs default to [0, 0]. Consequently, _requireWinningTicket accurately rejects any unminted or non-winning ticketId with TicketDoesNotContainWinningEntry, and no bypass or state corruption is possible.\"}\n","duration_seconds":17.207823,"usage":{"input_tokens":9929,"output_tokens":1593,"thinking_tokens":1430,"cache_read_tokens":20488,"total_tokens":11522}}}
